# FLIPR public repo.
# Only these belong here: flipr.user.js, LICENSE, README.txt, .gitignore.
# Everything else stays on the PC / in the private repo and is ignored below.

# --- Secrets / credentials: never in a public, auto-pushed repo ---
cloud/
*.pem
*.key
*serviceaccount*.json
*adminsdk*.json
.env
.env.*
*.secret
secrets.*

# --- Private dev docs & listings (live only in the private repo / on the PC) ---
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
CHANGELOG_*.html
CHANGELOG_*.md
*LISTING*.md
HANDOVER*.md
ROADMAP*.md
*_SPEC.md
NOTES*.md

# --- Local junk ---
*.bak
*.tmp
*.log
backups/
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
